{"body":{"kept":"Whole in the author's words: every utterance as it came, spoken but the last, typed; the one word the dictation misheard marked on the word, with what was written kept. The session's answers by their essence, short; the long stretch of writing and reading Knowledge in rounds is kept in the answers 16 and 18. The work stands in the main store's commit e669b7e7 and the README.","on":"2026-11-15","paths":[{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS617"},{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS618"},{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS619"},{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS61A"},{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS61B"}],"said":[{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS03B"},{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS050"},{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS0SE"},{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS0W9"},{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS201"},{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS21R"},{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS2G3"},{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS2JB"},{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS42H"},{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS44P"},{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS4C7"},{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS4DN"},{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS58B"},{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS5AZ"},{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS5N2"},{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS5SQ"},{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS5VX"},{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS616"},{"$ref":"1M7GH1YB0K1021Q"},{"$ref":"1M7GH20KN96W04F"}],"voice":{"$ref":"1M7GD279E4JS000"}},"id":"1M7GD279E4JS61C","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000000"],"name":"A fifteenth session: Knowledge written anew from the top, the design as primitives taking inspiration from reality, and the README made an opener","prev":"1a2919131a19cd09769c0a8084732cbb57aa04314b06d3ee174e34dc168ac854"}
